==Miscellaneous==
*Slow Beam, Iron Wall, and Thunderblast [[Ototo Corps|Cat Bases]] can now be upgraded to level 30 using the new material Ammonite, which looks like a [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] fossil.
**Ammonite can only be obtained from [[Uncanny Legends]] stages.
*All cats with access to [[Talents]] can equip [[Talent Orbs]].
*Regular Super Rare [[:Category:Gacha Cats|Gacha Cats]] have been moved in front of [[Rare Capsule Bonus Characters|limited units]].
*The [[Splash Text]] cat now notifies the player if there is a [[Zombie Outbreaks|Zombie Outbreak]].

